flowchart TD
    Q[Versioned questions and tasks] --> E[Evidence with source and provenance]
    E --> D[Dimension result]
    D --> S{Sufficiency state}
    S -->|Unknown or insufficient| M[Ask for more evidence]
    S -->|Contradictory| H[Human review or clarification]
    S -->|Tentative or supported| C[Career registry context]
    C --> SNAP[Versioned assessment and career snapshots]
    SNAP --> NEXT[Future Milestone 4 recommendation engine]
    NEXT -. requires owner approval and is not implemented .-> OUT[Explainable candidate directions]
    OUT -. future review gate .-> HUMAN[Human approval before participant delivery]